    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "text": "Chittorgarh (Raj.)\n ----Respondents",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 524,
      "end": 559,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "For Petitioner(s) : Mr. Pawan Singh Rathore\nFor Respondent(s) : Mr. Vikram Rajpurohit, Dy.G.A.\n Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Farjand Ali\nOrder 06/01/2025\n1. Heard.\n2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 560,
      "end": 718,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pawan Singh Rathore",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 585,
          "end": 604
        },
        {
          "text": "Vikram Rajpurohit",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 629,
          "end": 646
        },
        {
          "text": "Farjand Ali",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 677,
          "end": 688
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "The petitioner was charge-sheeted for committing offence under Sections 498A & 406 of IPC and the learned Magistrate framed charges against him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 719,
      "end": 864,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sections 498A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 783,
          "end": 796
        },
        {
          "text": "406",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 799,
          "end": 802
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 806,
          "end": 809
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "There are allegations that the victim was subjected to cruelty at the hands of petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 865,
      "end": 955,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The charge- sheet reveals commission of offence under Section 498A & 406 of IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 956,
      "end": 1036,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 498A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1010,
          "end": 1022
        },
        {
          "text": "406",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1025,
          "end": 1028
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1032,
          "end": 1035
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The petitioner has sought quashing of the entire judicial proceeding on the ground that at one point of time she was examined in a missing person report,\nwhere she narrated a different story then what has been made in this case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1037,
      "end": 1265,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "In my view, it can be a defence of the accused but the same may not be taken into account at the time of hearing on the point of charge and [2025:RJ-JD:651] (2 of 2) [CRLMP-5640/2024] reliance in this regard may be placed on the judgment passed by Hon'ble the Supreme Court in the case of State of Orissa vs.\nDebendra Nath Padhi [(2005) 1 SCC 568] .",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1266,
      "end": 1615,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Supreme Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1526,
          "end": 1539
        },
        {
          "text": "State of Orissa vs.\nDebendra Nath Padhi [(2005) 1 SCC 568]",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1555,
          "end": 1613
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "There is no force in the petition and the same deserves to be dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1616,
      "end": 1688,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
